  "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Asset type: Japanese elementary vocabulary illustrations, sheet 60. Edit the provided 2048x2048 template, painting ONLY inside its sixteen white panels. Every single panel MUST have identical width and height. All horizontal lines must be EXACTLY at 0%,25%,50%,75%,100%, not based on artwork. Keep precisely the 4x4 equal grid and 5 continuous pure magenta #ff00ff lines in each direction, including outer frame. Preserve line position, width and full canvas. Each panel is an independent clear gentle picture-book illustration as isolated vignettes on a pure white background, large and easily understood. Never use magenta for illustration. Avoid all pink, purple and neon colors in artwork, objects, decorations, lighting and shadows. Use warm orange, red, yellow, green, blue and neutral colors. No pink/purple concert lights. Nothing crosses the grid. No text, letters, numbers, labels, symbols resembling writing or watermarks. For abstract words show a concrete situation illustrating the meaning. Diverse natural children and adults, no stereotypes. Correct anatomy and objects. Panels in strict row-major order (left to right, top to bottom):\n1. 自主 — 自分の考えや判断で行うこと。\n2. 自習 — 先生に直接教わらず自分で学習すること。\n3. 自炊 — 自分で食事を作ること。\n4. 字数 — 文字の数。\n5. 時速 — 一時間に進む距離で表す速さ。\n6. 持続 — 同じ状態が続くこと。\n7. 字体 — 文字を組み立てる骨組みとなる形。\n8. 自宅 — 自分が住んでいる家。\n9. 時代 — 歴史や社会の特徴などで分けた時間のまとまり。\n10. 自治体 — 都道府県や市町村など地域の行政を行う団体。\n11. 実施 — 計画していたことを実際に行うこと。\n12. 実績 — 実際に行って得られた成果。\n13. 実技 — 知識だけでなく体などを使って実際に行う技術。\n14. 実在 — 実際に存在すること。\n15. 実名 — 本当の名前。\n16. 実用 — 実際の暮らしや仕事などで役立てて使うこと。\nSafety and clarity: Vehicles must be driven only by unmistakable adults, never children. Industrial machinery and knives are used by adults. Do not put a child in a car driver's seat. Keep artwork separated by the measured template grid.\nDo not add numerical claims, prices, quantities, currency denominations, calorie values or stroke-order numbers unless explicitly required by the target word. Mathematical concepts should have neutral concrete examples without unverified numeric diagrams.\n",
